From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 03:15:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [build] Remove --locked when building dash-ha

sonic-buildimage replaces dash-ha's locked git dependencies with local
paths. Allow Cargo to update those source entries before building.

---
 debian/rules | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/debian/rules b/debian/rules
--- a/debian/rules
+++ b/debian/rules
@@ -10 +10 @@ override_dh_auto_build:
-	cargo build --locked --release --all
+	cargo build --release --all
